    "preamble": "Sorab Khan S/O Kareem Khan vs State Of Rajasthan on 7 September, 2020",
    "facts": "Petitioner has filed third bail application under Section 439 of Cr.P.C. 2. F.I.R. No.503/2019 was registered at Police Station Kishangarh Bas, District Alwar for offence under Sections 420, 270, 272, 273 of I.P.C. and Section 5 of Prevention of Food Adulteration Act. 3. It is contended by counsel for the petitioner that charges have been framed. Offence under the Prevention of Food Adulteration Act is bailable. It is contended that petitioner has remained in custody for a period of nine months.",
